cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as described here."
title: "Pukara"
abstract: >-
  A privacy-first, self-hosted gateway for local large language models: a
  Dockerized Ollama server behind a pre-shared-key encrypted proxy (protocol
  v2: AES-256-GCM + HKDF-SHA256) and a desktop client that pseudonymises
  sensitive entities on-device (BERT + regex) before sending data to the
  server.
